#: motion.slint:53
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: motion.slint:70
msgid "Double Frame Rate shows twice the frames, with real in-between frames made by Apple's frame interpolation. Match Display also paces them to the display (GPU rendering only). Doubling makes film look like video, so it is off by default."
msgstr "“双倍帧率”显示两倍的帧，中间帧由 Apple 的插帧技术真实生成。“匹配显示器”还会按显示器刷新率输出（仅 GPU 渲染）。帧率翻倍会让电影看起来像录像，所以默认关闭。"

#: motion.slint:103
msgid "Needs a Mac with Apple silicon and macOS 15.4 or newer. How large a video the Mac keeps up with depends on the Mac: a size it fell far behind on twice waits until you turn smoothing off and on again or restart the player. HDR videos are not smoothed."
msgstr "需要搭载 Apple 芯片、macOS 15.4 或更新版本的 Mac。能跟上多大的视频取决于这台 Mac：某个尺寸两次严重跟不上之后，该尺寸会一直等待，直到你关闭再重新开启运动平滑，或重启播放器。HDR 视频不做平滑。"

#: motion.slint:109
msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"
